{"4537380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Appalachia", "steam_appid": 4537380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule number 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hills have been calling out to anybody willing to listen but a true Appalachian would know better than to go meddling in the forest at night. Something is causing trouble up here and the trail ain't what it once was. Uncover the mysteries of the mountains and come face to face with the most infamous horrors of Appalachian Folklore. Using your Thermal Imager and EMF meter you analyze, track and scout the hills of Appalachia but it doesn't take long to realize it's you that's being hunted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival horror experience that throws you into the hollers and the hills of Appalachia, you'll investigate the  trail and coal country in search of your missing Uncle and his neighbor Walter. Piecing together a mystery along the way you just may be able to restore some of that peace and quiet the old folks can't seem to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still actively in development. Information on this page is subject to change as the game's development progresses further.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule number 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/45db56686fcc86b332e2ee230065e9e0.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hills have been calling out to anybody willing to listen but a true Appalachian would know better than to go meddling in the forest at night. Something is causing trouble up here and the trail ain't what it once was. Uncover the mysteries of the mountains and come face to face with the most infamous horrors of Appalachian Folklore. Using your Thermal Imager and EMF meter you analyze, track and scout the hills of Appalachia but it doesn't take long to realize it's you that's being hunted.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/107001cb2146eb0ba6fbc6b52470e010.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A survival horror experience that throws you into the hollers and the hills of Appalachia, you'll investigate the  trail and coal country in search of your missing Uncle and his neighbor Walter. Piecing together a mystery along the way you just may be able to restore some of that peace and quiet the old folks can't seem to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.poster.avif?t=1784232437\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.webm?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/extras/8ba7a66071b9788c51b6857e031d8869.mp4?t=1784232437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still actively in development. Information on this page is subject to change as the game's development progresses further.</p>", "short_description": "The nightmares of Appalachian folklore haunt these hills but nothing is going to stop you from finding your missing Uncle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/15b86c060b8abeb843c53738ec6fd789ff811b34/header.jpg?t=1784232437", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/ca7aa06481a31b693b1ca520c9d74169160f5b47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784232437", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537380/ca7aa06481a31b693b1ca520c9d74169160f5b47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784232437", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later, 64-bit version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> none</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["NIBIRU RED"], "publisher